which listings still ask for beginners.

00:03:20.751 --> 00:03:25.391
If you are planning a summer job or a first career, look for openings that mix human

00:03:25.391 --> 00:03:27.971
skills with AI tools rather than racing them.

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:34.348
Wikipedia, the daily star explorers, might team up with chat tools like chat GPT instead

00:03:34.348 --> 00:03:35.068
of fighting them.

00:03:35.608 --> 00:03:40.388
Facts that people already checked on Wikipedia could steady AI answers, and those tools

00:03:40.388 --> 00:03:44.968
could make that same knowledge easier to browse. School research could then offer both

00:03:44.968 --> 00:03:47.908
verified information and a simpler way to move through it.

